### REST Client Test File
### For VSCode REST Client extension

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@dbName = testdb
@testDbUrl = sqlite:///./test.db

### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:8000/health

###

### 2. List All Database Connections
GET {{baseUrl}}/database

###

### 3. Create Database Connection
POST {{baseUrl}}/database
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "{{dbName}}",
  "connection_string": "{{testDbUrl}}",
  "description": "Test database for API testing"
}

###

### 4. Get Specific Database Connection (replace with actual ID)
@dbId = 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/database/{{dbId}}

###

### 5. Get Database Metadata
GET {{baseUrl}}/database/{{dbId}}/metadata

###

### 6. Execute SQL Query
POST {{baseUrl}}/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "database_id": {{dbId}},
  "sql_query": "SELECT name FROM sqlite_master WHERE type='table'"
}

###

### 7. Execute Natural Language Query
POST {{baseUrl}}/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "database_id": {{dbId}},
  "natural_language_query": "Show me all the tables in this database"
}

###

### 8. Get Query History
GET {{baseUrl}}/query/history?database_id={{dbId}}&limit=10

###

### 9. Get All Query History
GET {{baseUrl}}/query/history

###

### 10. Delete Database Connection
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/database/{{dbId}}